dialect protocol
protocol en1991.mutations
version 1
schema norm.en1991.mutations
start record
framing record

# `En1991Mutation` op frame (this crate's `native_codec`): `format u8` (`OP_BINARY_FORMAT`), then
# `tag varint`, `len varint`, then the mutation as canonical UTF-8 JSON (the tag is a varint because the kinds outgrew one byte). Each record is
# one mutation kind at its wire tag; this file is the only source of those tags, looked up by the kind's semantic kind.
